    `A threatened death, hurt or continued detention` IS FALSE
    `A's conduct gave a reasonable apprehension of death, hurt or continued detention` IS FALSE
    `A caused death or hurt to B` IS FALSE
    `to compel a government or intergovernmental organisation` IS FALSE
    `to compel any other person` IS TRUE
    `an offence under s 3 of the Geneva Conventions Act 1973` IS FALSE

